CODESWIFT - DESKTOP MARKDOWN EDITOR & SNIPPET MANAGER
=====================================================

Thank you for your purchase!

This package contains the CodeSwift desktop application.

WHAT'S INCLUDED:
- macOS build (Universal Binary)
- Windows build (x64 installer)
- Linux AppImage
- Documentation PDF
- License key (activated on first launch)

FEATURES:
- Vim keybindings & code folding
- 50+ Language syntax highlighting
- Local-first security with encrypted backup
- Cloud sync (optional)
- Snippet library with tagging
- Hotkey expansions

